    "body": "LOGICAL_AGENT = LESTER\nROLE = TECH / IMPLEMENTATION\nASSIGNED_BY = JINGO\nOWNER = SPARX\nSTATE = ASSIGNED / REAL IMPLEMENTATION REQUIRED\n\n## AUTHORITY\nOwner-approved spec:\n`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-salvador-v1-canon-reference-edit-design.md`\n\nOwner-approved implementation plan:\n`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-26-salvador-v1-canon-reference-edit.md`\n\nApproval PR: #55\nApproval comment: #55 comment `5429897291`\nExact approved plan head: `647f8276f227f3f90b86a239b965f34c5a9c8b3e`\nBase before design/plan: `cf68c4882f84d8d0cce07f05ccc15345b913ddca`\n\n## TASK\nImplement **Tasks 1–7 only** from the approved plan, exactly by TDD.\n\nRequired production task kind:\n`CANON_REFERENCE_EDIT`\n\nRequired architecture:\n- existing smoke path stays intact;\n- separate production backend;\n- immutable repository canon prompt + task-specific direction;\n- safe deterministic local reference staging;\n- SD1.5-class img2img baseline workflow only;\n- no ControlNet in baseline;\n- external deployment-owned model identity;\n- restart-safe provenance;\n- mocked end-to-end lifecycle regression;\n- zero paid API.\n\n## HARD GATES\n- Do NOT start Task 8 yourself; Duncan owns independent QC.\n- Do NOT start Task 9 live model smoke before Duncan PASS.\n- Do NOT download/select a random production checkpoint automatically.\n- Do NOT use production locked face/body art for initial model smoke.\n- Do NOT merge PR #55 as part of implementation authority.\n- Do NOT activate production.\n- `ASSIGNED != RUNNING`.\n\n## EXECUTION PROTOCOL\nWhen real implementation starts, post:\n`LESTER_SALVADOR_V1_IMPLEMENTATION_RUNNING`\nwith exact working branch and starting commit.\n\nAfter Tasks 1–7 are complete, post:\n\n`LESTER_SALVADOR_V1_IMPLEMENTATION_READY`\n`EXACT_HEAD = <sha>`\n`TESTS = <fresh exact result>`\n`COMPILE = PASS`\n`TASKS_1_7 = PASS`\n`SMOKE_PATH_REGRESSION = PASS`\n`PRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO`\n`NEXT = DUNCAN TASK 8 QC`\n\nNo success claim without fresh test/compile evidence.",
